@HotelBooking.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7131

### Register a Customer
POST {{HotelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "phone": "0900000000"
}

### Login
POST {{HotelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### Authenticated profile (replace token)
GET {{HotelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Staff-only resource
GET {{HotelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin-only resource
GET {{HotelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
